{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">123 MAZES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relax. Escape. Chill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>123 MAZES</i> is a soothing 2D single-player puzzle game built to help you unwind, destress, and feel a sense of calm accomplishment. Navigate through 123 mazes using simple, intuitive controls \u2014 either your keyboard, a gamepad controller, or effortless mouse-hover movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 FEATURES \u2726</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>123 progressively challenging mazes</strong> \u2013 a perfect blend of chill and brain-teasing<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>13 ball colors</strong> to match your favorite color <br>\ud83c\udf04 <strong>4 unique background packs</strong>: Scenery, Animals, Fantasy, Sci-Fi, and more!<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>5 genres of relaxing music</strong> to choose from<br>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Fully customizable</strong>: ball speed, controls, themes, and more<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Frustration-free design</strong> with soft dark background options \u2014 easy on the eyes<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>100+ Achievements</strong> for the completionists and goal-setters</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 WHO\u2019S IT FOR?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re a:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maze enthusiast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kids looking for fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Senior wanting something gentle and engaging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mental health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievement hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual gamer seeking to destress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>123 MAZES</strong> is your go-to relaxing escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modern graphics. Minimal stress. Maximum Zen.</strong><br>Just pick a color, a tune, and start your journey through clean, calming mazes.</p>","background"